      "In practice, most businesses that stay in the UAE market for more than a year or two end up needing both — Google Ads for immediate, controllable visibility, and SEO for the visibility that keeps compounding whether or not the ad budget is active that month.",
      "## Google Ads and SEO side by side",
      "- Speed: Google Ads can show your business within days of launch. SEO typically takes several months to show meaningful movement.\n- Cost model: Google Ads charges for every click. SEO costs time, content and technical work, but clicks themselves are free.\n- Control: with Google Ads you choose the keywords, locations, schedule and budget. With SEO, Google decides what ranks, and you influence it.\n- Durability: ad visibility stops when spend stops. Organic rankings usually decline gradually rather than disappearing overnight.\n- Testing: Google Ads is excellent for quickly learning which services, messages and keywords produce enquiries. Those lessons can then guide your SEO content.",
