      "## What each one is actually for",
      "- Organic content: builds credibility, shows your work and personality, answers common questions, and gives people a reason to remember you.\n- Paid social ads: reach new people who match your ideal customer, promote a specific offer, retarget website visitors, and generate enquiries at a measurable cost.\n- Together: ads bring people in, organic content convinces them you're real and worth contacting.",
