      "Divide your target enquiries by the conversion rate to get the clicks you need, then multiply by the cost per click. For example, if you want 30 enquiries a month, expect a 5% conversion rate and see clicks around AED 10, you'd need roughly 600 clicks — around AED 6,000 a month. That's a worked illustration, not a benchmark; your own numbers will differ.",
