      "## Content and authority checklist",
      "- Publish genuinely useful articles that answer specific customer questions, not generic content written only for keywords.\n- Avoid thin or duplicate pages — a few strong pages beat many weak ones.\n- Earn mentions and links from relevant sources: industry associations, local partners, suppliers, media coverage and reputable directories.\n- Link the website from every profile you control, such as social media and your parent company's site.",
